hid-remapper: keep the USB host working when devices behind a hub come and go (an ATEN switch moving
away from this port mid-enumeration left the hub unconfigured and its ports unpowered until a reboot).
usbh.c: root removal ends any enumeration; stale attaches dropped; attach waits for a busy control
pipe; stuck control transfers/enumerations failed after 5 s; failed enumerations start over from a
port reset (3 in a row at most). hub.c: failed hub requests keep the status endpoint polled; a port
switched off by over-current is powered again (3 per hub at most).
Applied by .github/workflows/build-feather*.yml before the build.

